      en: ["Located in the northern Bagoué region", "Geomorphological type: granitic inselberg", "Center for Senoufo spiritual rites", "Surrounded by extensive cotton plantations", "Home to rare African birds of prey", "Seasonal waterfalls during the rainy season"],
